sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant R as Requester Agent
    participant S as Specialist Agent
    participant RAG as RAG Pipeline
    participant LLM as Groq LLM
    participant PW as Playwright

    User->>R: support request

    R->>S: POST /tasks
    activate S
    S-->>R: 202 task_id, status=submitted
    deactivate S

    Note over S: background task starts

    S->>S: status = working

    S->>RAG: answer(question)
    RAG->>LLM: expand into 3 query variations
    LLM-->>RAG: alternative queries
    RAG->>RAG: dense + BM25 retrieval per query
    RAG->>RAG: Reciprocal Rank Fusion
    RAG->>LLM: generate answer from retrieved context
    LLM-->>RAG: category, resolution, sources
    RAG-->>S: result + confidence

    loop every 2s, max 30s
        R->>S: GET /tasks/{task_id}
        S-->>R: status
    end

    alt confidence below 0.30
        S->>S: status = failed
        Note right of S: insufficient_context
        R-->>User: rejected, browser never opens
    else category not in form dropdown
        S->>S: status = failed
        Note right of S: unsupported_category
        R-->>User: rejected, browser never opens
    else no response within 30s
        R-->>User: TimeoutError
    else success
        S->>S: status = completed
        S-->>R: result
        R->>PW: submit_ticket(question, result)
        PW->>PW: fill issue, category, resolution fields
        PW->>PW: click submit-ticket button
        PW->>PW: verify confirmation, read ticket-id
        PW-->>R: ticket ID
        R-->>User: ticket submitted
    end
